        "filing_date": "2026-05-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, through our deep customer and partner relationships, we have unique visibility into the future requirements of end markets many years out, which informs the development of our products to ensure that our products meet or exceed future market needs.",
